-- =============================================================================
-- NEXORA SALONOS — landing-page content seed
-- =============================================================================
-- Generated by scripts/generate-nexora-landing-db-seed.mjs from the live
-- landing-page content modules. Re-run the generator after copy changes.
--
-- Publishing rules honoured here:
--   * pricing_plans.price_monthly stays NULL (no monthly rate is configured);
--   * price_yearly holds the approved GST-inclusive annual total only;
--   * plan_features contains ONLY the explicitly confirmed Standard
--     entitlements — unconfirmed tier assignments are absent, not guessed;
--   * promotional_creatives are DRAFTS until the image objects are uploaded
--     to the nexora-public-assets bucket;
--   * testimonials are intentionally NOT seeded (no approved quote exists);
--   * landing_leads is never seeded with example data.
--
-- Idempotent: every insert is keyed on a natural unique key.
-- =============================================================================

-- site_settings — singleton row. Contact details stay NULL: no official
-- support email, phone number or WhatsApp link has been published.
